---
---

<section class="reveal-on-scroll w-full bg-[#09090b] text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-16 lg:border-x lg:border-b border-[#27272a] lg:px-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[680px] mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-[1.85rem] font-medium leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[2.25rem] lg:text-[2.5rem]">
        Sigurnost i privatnost na razini velikih sustava
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] text-[#a1a1aa]">
        Poštujemo najstrože europske standarde zaštite podataka i koristimo napredne protokole enkripcije kako bi vaše poslovanje bilo zaštićeno.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Compliance Visual Cards -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- GDPR Card -->
      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#27272a] bg-[#121215] transition-all hover:border-[#3f3f46]">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#18181b] border-b border-[#27272a]">
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/card-gdpr-visual.1ikzwwtpzyhl3.webp"
            alt="GDPR usklađenost"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/badge-gdpr.0mwhtxr8zcwlz.webp"
            alt="GDPR bedž"
            class="absolute top-4 right-4 h-9 w-auto object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-white">GDPR Usklađenost</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
            Serveri smješteni unutar Europske unije s potpunom podrškom za Ugovor o obradi podataka (DPA) i pravo na zaborav.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tenant Isolation Card -->
      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#27272a] bg-[#121215] transition-all hover:border-[#3f3f46]">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#18181b] border-b border-[#27272a]">
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/card-soc2-visual.33ajmh-_bdvcd.webp"
            alt="Sigurnost i izolacija podataka"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/badge-soc2.0nzdz4e2zqxf5.webp"
            alt="Certificirana sigurnost"
            class="absolute top-4 right-4 h-9 w-auto object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-white">Izolacija podataka po klijentu</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
            Svaki radni prostor posjeduje vlastitu izoliranu bazu znanja i vektorski indeks s kriptografskom zaštitom.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Health & Sensitive Data Card -->
      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#27272a] bg-[#121215] transition-all hover:border-[#3f3f46]">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#18181b] border-b border-[#27272a]">
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/card-hipaa-visual.0m6it89z7irko.webp"
            alt="Zaštita osjetljivih podataka"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
          <img
            src="/chatbase-assets/badge-hipaa.262e6npya536m.webp"
            alt="Sigurnosni bedž"
            class="absolute top-4 right-4 h-9 w-auto object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-white">Zaštita osjetljivih podataka</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
            Automatska anonimizacija osobnih podataka kupaca (PII filtri) prije slanja jezičnim modelima.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Core Security Pillars -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 border-t border-[#27272a] pt-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-white">Nema treniranja javnih modela</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
          Vaši interni dokumenti i razgovori kupaca se NIKADA ne koriste za treniranje ili poboljšavanje javnih LLM modela.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-white">Enkripcija u mirovanju i prijenosu</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
          Svi mrežni pozivi kriptirani su putem modernog TLS 1.3 protokola, dok su spremljeni podaci enkriptirani AES-256 algoritmom.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-white">Sigurne službene integracije</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#a1a1aa]">
          Povezivanje s WhatsAppom, Instagramom, Shopifyjem i WordPressom vrši se kroz službene OAuth i API tokene.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
